<title>USA: Mantua Township, N.J. won by Commerce Capital.</title>
<headline>Mantua Township, N.J. won by Commerce Capital.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commerce Capital said it won $1.845 million of Mantua Township, N.J., general obligation bonds, Series 1997, with the lowest rate  of 4.75, highest price of 100.011.</p>
